  titulo: A Chance to Buy an App
  arteCarta: {fileID: 5602091570812747121, guid: 5171059098c94144f807d8d7a8f03611, type: 3}
  descricao: You have the opportunity to acquire a popular app called Writing. Will
    you invest?
  contratar:
    textoResultado: You decide to invest in Writing and acquire the popular app,
      adding a successful new product to your company's portfolio. The app continues
      to grow in popularity, bringing you significant profits and strengthening your
      position in the tech industry.
    deltaDinheiro: 20000
    arteResultado: {fileID: 0}
  naoContratar:
    textoResultado: You decide not to invest in Writing. Fortunately, your own company's
      app unexpectedly becomes a massive success, attracting millions of users and
      generating enormous profits, significantly increasing your wealth.
    deltaDinheiro: 40000
    arteResultado: {fileID: 0}
